        "text": "theorem normalizedPrimitive_factorization (c : ℝ) (j : ℕ) (b : ℝ → ℝ)\n    {x : ℝ} (hx : 0 ≤ x) :\n    primitive c j b x = scale c j x * normalizedPrimitive c j b x"
